<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-AUSTRIAN OPEN WOMEN'S QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRIAN OPEN WOMEN'S QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LINZ, Austria 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the</p>
<p>Austrian Open women's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Judith Wiesner (Austria) beat 6-Nathalie Tauziat (France) 7-5</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>.2-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) beat 8-Asa Carlsson (Sweden) 6-2</p>
<p>6-2</p>
</text>
